     1,
     "<font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">I was looking at an activity budget for a species of study completed in Namibia. What argument should I use in Tz? Let me know what you think should be the correct time zone and where is the list of all time zones I can find?</font><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">datasq$Time.rad &lt;- (as.numeric(as.POSIXct(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">strptime(datasq$timeonly, format = &quot;%H:%M:%S&quot;, tz = </span><b style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">&quot;Asia/Kuala_Lumpur&quot;</b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">))) -as.numeric(as.POSIXct(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">strptime(&quot;0&quot;, format = &quot;%S&quot;, tz = &quot;Asia/Kuala_Lumpur&quot;)))) / 3600 * (pi/12)</span><font color=\"#888888\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br><div> </div></font>"
    ]
   ]
